# Fibonacci-style number sequence in Alya
# Demonstrates the power of arithmetic expressions

say "Number sequence demonstration:"
say "Starting with Fibonacci-like pattern"

# First 10 Fibonacci numbers shown explicitly
say "First 10 Fibonacci numbers:"
say 0
say 1
say 1
say 2
say 3
say 5
say 8
say 13
say 21
say 34

say "Computing Fibonacci numbers with expressions:"
say "Manual calculations demonstrating how to compute Fibonacci:"
say "F(5) = F(4) + F(3) = 3 + 2 = "
say 3 + 2

say "F(6) = F(5) + F(4) = 5 + 3 = "
say 5 + 3

say "F(7) = F(6) + F(5) = 8 + 5 = "
say 8 + 5

say "F(8) = F(7) + F(6) = 13 + 8 = "
say 13 + 8
